summary:
  The footer's rule takes only a title or a file for sound, as it did.

history:
  A station played back from its buffer has no title and no bitrate. The
  footer read "Connecting…" over 44 s of music on a real panel on
  2026-11-12, and a live station without titles read the same.

target:
  package/contents/ui/ViewLogic.js

find:
    return titled === true || local === true || (typeof posMs === "number" && isFinite(posMs) && posMs > 0);

replace:
    return titled === true || local === true;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_viewlogic.qml::test_a_stream_whose_position_moved_sounds.
  Line-neutral.
